<div id="hhdb-root"><p><span id="hhdb-en--1-{{district_code}}">Published median monthly household income · HK$ · 2021</span><span id="hhdb-tc--1-{{district_code}}">已公布家庭住戶每月收入中位數 · 港元 · 2021</span><span id="hhdb-sc--1-{{district_code}}">已公布家庭住户每月收入中位数 · 港元 · 2021</span></p><p><span id="hhdb-en--2-{{district_code}}">Light blue: all households · Dark blue: economically active households</span><span id="hhdb-tc--2-{{district_code}}">淺藍：全體住戶 · 深藍：經濟活躍住戶</span><span id="hhdb-sc--2-{{district_code}}">浅蓝：全体住户 · 深蓝：经济活跃住户</span></p><div id="hhdb-axis"><span><span id="hhdb-en--3-{{district_code}}">District</span><span id="hhdb-tc--3-{{district_code}}">地區</span><span id="hhdb-sc--3-{{district_code}}">地区</span></span><div id="hhdb-ticks"><span>0</span><span>10,000</span><span>20,000</span><span>30,000</span><span>40,000</span><span>50,000</span><span>60,000</span><span>70,000</span></div><span><span id="hhdb-en--4-{{district_code}}">Difference (HK$)</span><span id="hhdb-tc--4-{{district_code}}">差額（港元）</span><span id="hhdb-sc--4-{{district_code}}">差额（港元）</span></span></div>{{#each data}}<div id="hhdb-row--{{district_code}}"><span><span id="hhdb-en--5-{{district_code}}">{{district_name}}</span><span id="hhdb-tc--5-{{district_code}}">{{district_name_zh}}</span><span id="hhdb-sc--5-{{district_code}}">{{lookup (parseJson '{"11":"中西区","12":"湾仔区","13":"东区","14":"南区","23":"深水埗区","24":"九龙城区","25":"黄大仙区","26":"观塘区","27":"油尖旺区","31":"葵青区","32":"荃湾区","33":"屯门区","34":"元朗区","35":"北区","36":"大埔区","37":"沙田区","38":"西贡区","39":"离岛区"}') district_code}}</span></span><div id="hhdb-track--{{district_code}}"><span id="hhdb-start--{{district_code}}" title="{{all_position}}%"><span id="hhdb-link--{{district_code}}" title="{{gap_width}}%"></span></span><span id="hhdb-dot-all--{{district_code}}" title="{{all_position}}%" tabindex="0"><span id="hhdb-tip-all--{{district_code}}"><span id="hhdb-en--6-{{district_code}}">All households</span><span id="hhdb-tc--6-{{district_code}}">全體住戶</span><span id="hhdb-sc--6-{{district_code}}">全体住户</span>: HK${{formatNumber all_households_median "en-HK"}}</span></span><span id="hhdb-dot-active--{{district_code}}" title="{{active_position}}%" tabindex="0"><span id="hhdb-tip-active--{{district_code}}"><span id="hhdb-en--7-{{district_code}}">Economically active households</span><span id="hhdb-tc--7-{{district_code}}">經濟活躍住戶</span><span id="hhdb-sc--7-{{district_code}}">经济活跃住户</span>: HK${{formatNumber active_households_median "en-HK"}}</span></span></div><span id="hhdb-gap--{{district_code}}">{{formatNumber median_difference "en-HK"}}</span></div>{{else}}<p><span id="hhdb-en--8-{{district_code}}">No matching districts</span><span id="hhdb-tc--8-{{district_code}}">沒有符合條件的地區</span><span id="hhdb-sc--8-{{district_code}}">没有符合条件的地区</span></p>{{/each}}<p id="hhdb-foot"><span id="hhdb-en--9-{{district_code}}">Sorted by the difference. Economically active households are a subset of all households. The connector compares populations, not change over time. Hover or focus either dot for its median.</span><span id="hhdb-tc--9-{{district_code}}">按差額排列。經濟活躍住戶屬全體住戶的一部分；連線比較兩組住戶，並非時間變化。移至或選取圓點可查看中位數。</span><span id="hhdb-sc--9-{{district_code}}">按差额排列。经济活跃住户属全体住户的一部分；连线比较两组住户，并非时间变化。移至或选取圆点可查看中位数。</span></p></div>
